<!--T:37-->
Works by the government of the Philippines are not protected by copyright. A prior approval of the government is necessary for exploitation of such works for profit. However, the clause for prior approval is determined to be a {{pg|Commons:Non-copyright restrictions|non-copyright restriction}} and can be safely ignored for the purposes of Wikimedia Commons by policy.
